---
args: {"quote": "QuoteOption", "evidence": "EvidencePage[]"}
returns: "QuoteOption"
---
Interpret each if, provided-that, exclusive, minimum-volume and early-commitment clause. Record its full proposition, dependent offers and source. An exclusive-volume discount is compatible only with the supplier receiving the specified exclusive scope; splitting that scope invalidates the discount, even if the total price looks favorable. Preserve an unrecognized condition as other plus a blocker. Return the quote with all conditions intact.
